{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263ZHtI9WB4w1794899387.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平與出席亞太經合組織APEC會議的外國領導人舉行雙邊會晤。</p><p></p><p>加拿大總理卡尼周二在深圳與習近平會晤，習近平表示，自今年1月雙方同意推進中加新型戰略夥伴關係後，兩國恢復各領域交流合作，中加關係健康穩定發展，符合兩國共同利益。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.APEC.XI-1301_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YFjOWXH8CI1794899400.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>卡尼指，加中之間交流顯著增加，且更具可預測和穩定性，又提到加拿大對中國出口遠超預期，目標是在2030年前增加五成。</p><p></p><p>習近平亦會見巴布亞新幾內亞總理馬拉佩，以及越共中央總書記、國家主席蘇林。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:08.210890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:57:08.308684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:23:31.468712+00:00","content_hash":"3af2277ed010bf4ab3123011ce6ef4850d1c715b93c6e02642b3a04a216651f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:30:08.210890+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}